4	\N	2	\N	\N	1	\N	2	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	sales	comment	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	<093609908597050.1776189786.563611030578613-openerp-2-discuss.channel@41d5ae3be8b4>	"OdooBot" <odoobot@example.com>	\N	<p>I noted I can not manage efficiently my pipeline when I have more than 50 opportunities in the qualification stage.</p><p>Any advice on this? How do you organize your activities with more than 50 opportunities?</p>	\N	\N	t	2026-04-10 18:03:00	\N	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424
5	4	2	\N	\N	1	\N	7	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	sales	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	<375639006631397.1776189786.573826551437378-openerp-2-discuss.channel@41d5ae3be8b4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>When I have too much opportunities in the pipe, I start communicating with prospects more by email than phonecalls.</p><p>I send an email to create a sense of emergency, like <i>"can I call you this week about our quote?"</i> and I call only those that answer this email.</p><p>You can use the email template feature of Odoo to automate email composition.</p>	\N	\N	t	2026-04-11 18:03:00	\N	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424
6	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	7	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	general	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	<745389058193567.1776189786.583451986312866-openerp-1-discuss.channel@41d5ae3be8b4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>\n    Great news!<br>\n    Our company has received the Deloitte Fast 50 award.  We are the fastest\n    growing company of the country, with a growth of 1549% over the past 5\n    years. You can get more information <a href="http://www.openerp.com/node/1244/2012/10">on our blog</a>.\n</p>\n	\N	\N	t	2026-04-14 17:41:00	\N	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424
7	\N	1	\N	\N	1	\N	7	\N	\N	1	1	\N	discuss.channel	general	comment	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	<778935967794113.1776189786.595241546630859-openerp-1-discuss.channel@41d5ae3be8b4>	"Marc Demo" <mark.brown23@example.com>	\N	<p>Your monthly meal vouchers arrived. You can get them at the HR's office.</p>\n<p>This month you also get 250 EUR of eco-vouchers if you have been in the company for more than a year.</p>	\N	\N	t	2026-04-14 17:03:00	\N	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424	2026-04-14 18:02:52.563424
